{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these","id":488990,"title":"Trinity Starship Sheets...did any fan make these?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-22T20:43:42-07:00","id":488990,"title":"Trinity Starship Sheets...did any fan make these?","content":"I've been searching the Internet recently for them but haven't found anything....although I still have an old (circa 2000) printout of a fan-made Trinity Starship sheet (that uses the original Trinity borders) that I did find years ago. The bad news is, the file got lost in one of my old computers. A Google image search didn't turn up anything similar to my printout either. And Mr. Gone doesn't have anything fan-made for Trinity, so no luck there either.<br /> <br /> I'll probably scan this printout I do have and make it available upon request, just so everyone can see its format if they want to make fan-made starship sheets for Trinity.<br /> <br /> Anyway, does anyone know of any fan-made starship sheets for Trinity available for download now?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-22T21:37:58-07:00","id":489013,"title":"","content":"No idea where to find something like that...or if it even existed...BUT, I would love to get a look at your scanned copy <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T11:21:48-07:00","id":489672,"title":"","content":"If anyone does find any let me know and I can dump them in the public archive folder we've got going on <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0B6FYbpbzU8JCfjdWVmQyQjFyaml5VVBVc2lGWGVLZEQ1YzFTbkVtN0VfUHhSLW9idl9yV0U&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">over here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T15:25:24-07:00","id":489895,"title":"","content":"I just scanned my copy even though it's already partially filled in. I wrote up stats for a Leviathan-class jumpship named <i>Chicago</i>. (Not a canon name for a jumpship obviously, but I wanted something different from all the Hindu and African names like <i>Svaha </i>and <i>Shaka</i>.)<br /> <br /> The question is, how do I get it to you guys? Also, I remember there being 3 versions of this starship sheet: one for hybrids, one for frigates and one for freighters, with the only real difference between the versions was the number of Structural Levels for each type of ship. None of the 3 versions was labeled as such on their sheet. Indeed, the sheet doesn't even have a title saying it's a startship sheet or even that it's related to Trinity at all. Aside from that, it seems to have all the needed stats for a Trinity starship.<br /> <br /> (This reminds me, are jumpships essentially freighters or are they considered a class of ship on their own?)<br /> <br /> CHILL and ManBearPig, PM me with your email addys and I'll send you each a copy of the scan. I'll have to put my Google docs link back in my siggy soon and add the PDF to my Google Docs account soon as well.<br /> <br /> EDIT: CHILL and ManBearPig, I just sent each of you PMs asking for your email addys. The PDF scan will be sent to each of you upon request.<br /> <br /> EDIT2: Also made a request for Mr. Gone to see what he can do with making a starship sheet based on my scan. Stay tuned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-23-2015, 09:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T23:49:33-07:00","id":490269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CHILL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=489672#post489672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anyone does find any let me know and I can dump them in the public archive folder we've got going on <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0B6FYbpbzU8JCfjdWVmQyQjFyaml5VVBVc2lGWGVLZEQ1YzFTbkVtN0VfUHhSLW9idl9yV0U&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">over here</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let us know when you do, i'm interested to see what Su-tehp is going on about at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T0