":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T08:24:38-07:00","id":491662,"title":"","content":"And they are uploaded to the archive. Hit the red link in my sig, then on the community screen hit the link in the right hand panel for the 'EON &amp; More Archive'. Folder called 'Trinity - Vehicle Sheets'. As always, happy to store more fan material if it'll be useful to people <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T08:32:28-07:00","id":491673,"title":"","content":"I'm slightly embarrassed to admit i've never seen those before, thanks for bringing it up, Su-tehp. Also interested to see what Mr. Gone might have in mind.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T09:40:58-07:00","id":491707,"title":"","content":"Just downloaded the vehicle sheets from CHILL's EON Archive. Gonna look at them now, but they look very nice at first glance. Stay tuned.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nihilist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=491673#post491673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm slightly embarrassed to admit i've never seen those before, thanks for bringing it up, Su-tehp. Also interested to see what Mr. Gone might have in mind.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't be embarrassed. This sheet is at least 15 years old and the only reason I have it is because I used it to make a sheet for a Leviathan-class jumpship just for shits and giggles and I managed to keep the copy with my Trinity books for that same 15 years. Hell, the website I found it on is probably <i>long </i>gone. I tried to find it via Google Images just the other day and came up empty. Then I figured, &quot;why not post on the OPP forums and see what anyone knows about this?&quot;<br /> <br /> Then I did the smart thing: I went to Mr. Gone. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-25-2015, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T10:14:35-07:00","id":491731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CHILL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=491662#post491662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And they are uploaded to the archive. Hit the red link in my sig, then on the community screen hit the link in the right hand panel for the 'EON &amp; More Archive'. Folder called 'Trinity - Vehicle Sheets'. As always, happy to store more fan material if it'll be useful to people <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Any issues if I maybe modify these for my purposes? Assuming they'll work for my purposes that is....but I wanted to ask. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=491707#post491707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just downloaded the vehicle sheets from CHILL's EON Archive. Gonna look at them now, but they look very nice at first glance. Stay tuned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let me know about the Structural stats..<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=491707#post491707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then I did the smart thing: I went to Mr. Gone. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Hopefully I can help...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T10:43:42-07:00","id":491752,"title":"","content":"MOVED FROM PREVIOUS POST: Ok, rules for Structural Levels for each type of ship: Trinity Technology Manual, p.135 says that there are 3 types: Hybrids with 8 SLs; Frigates with 12 SLs; and Freighters with 15 SLs<br /> <br /> So where did the Cruiser and Scout types come from? Or did White Wolf goof and forget that these two types mentioned in the color section needed to be included in the rules section?<br /> <br /> Just how many types of spaceships are there and how many Structural Levels do they have? Mr. Gone's scale from smallest to largest is:<br /> <br /> Fighter(4 SLs) &gt; Hybrid(8 SLs) &gt; Scout(12 SLs) &gt; Frigate(15 SLs) &gt; Cruiser(20 SLs)<br /> <br /> Mr. G, where did you come up with these numbers? I didn't see them in either the corebook or the Technology Manual. And where do freighters and/or jumpships fit into this scale?<br /> <br /> Ok, finished reading through the color section of Technology Manual and Gone's scale is roughly correct: Scouts are referred to as &quot;small frigates&quot; and cruisers are indeed larger than standard frigates. And what's more, cruisers are designed to attach to Leviathan-class jumpships, so it looks like we need an additional sheet for freighters/jumpships at the very least. Just how many Structural Levels will a jumpship have if it's designed to carry something as big as several cruisers? Something like 30 Structural Levels? Remember, Leviathans are 1.2 kilometers long and almost as wide....<br /> <br /> EDIT: Just sent off another email to Mr. Gone with my concerns. He and I are conversing on how to make the sheets prettier as well as trying to figure out how many SLs the new freighter sheet is going to need. CHILL, we should have new sheets for you pretty soon. (&quot;Soon&quot; of course meaning &quot;whenever Mr. Gone gets it done.&quot;)<br /> <br /> Stay tuned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-25-2015, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T13:06:48-07:00","id":491883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=491752#post491752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">MOVED FROM PREVIOUS POST: Ok, rules for Structural Levels for each type of ship: Trinity Technology Manual, p.135 says that there are 3 types: Hybrids with 8 SLs; Frigates with 12 SLs; and Freighters with 15 SLs<br /> <br /> So where did the Cruiser and Scout types come from? Or did White Wolf goof and forget that these two types mentioned in the color section needed to be included in the rules section?<br /> <br /> Just how many types of spaceships are there and how many Structural Levels do they have? Mr. Gone's scale from smallest to largest is:<br /> <br /> Fighter(4 SLs) &gt; Hybrid(8 SLs) &gt; Scout(12 SLs) &gt; Frigate(15 SLs) &gt; Cruiser(20 SLs)<br /> <br /> Mr. G, where did you come up with these numbers? I didn't see them in either the corebook or the Technology Manual. And where do freighters and/or jumpships fit into this scale?<br /> <br /> Ok, finished reading through the color section of Technology Manual and Gone's scale is roughly correct: Scouts are referred to as &quot;small frigates&quot; and cruisers are indeed larger than standard frigates. And what's more, cruisers are designed to attach to Leviathan-class jumpships, so it looks like we need an additional sheet for freighters/jumpships at the very least. Just how many Structural Levels will a jumpship have if it's designed to carry something as big as several cruisers? Something like 30 Structural Levels? Remember, Leviathans are 1.2 kilometers long and almost as wide....<br /> <br /> EDIT: Just sent off another email to Mr. Gone with my concerns. He and I are conversing on how to make the sheets prettier as well as trying to figure out how many SLs the new freighter sheet is going to need. CHILL, we should have new sheets for you pretty soon. (&quot;Soon&quot; of course meaning &quot;whenever Mr. Gone gets it done.&quot;)<br /> <br /> Stay tuned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure you mean me when it comes to the scales...since I didn't even know Trinity needed ship sheets. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll check the email and take it from there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T14:42:20-07:00","id":491942,"title":"","content":"Just exchanged a few emails with Mr. Gone about my suggestions, including for the freighter sheet. Stay tuned.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Mr. Gone just sent me his first draft and it looks AMAZING. I just sent off a couple of suggestions to Mr. G to touch it up, including making the lines typable/interactive and making sure all the sheets were horizontally oriented (to make them easier to type on, natch). They should be done soon and then we'll send them off to CHILL for inclusion in the EON Archive.<br /> <br /> Now for the &quot;bad&quot; news. The Structural Levels on these sheets are totally untested, so I have no idea how they'll perform in playtesting. I'm hoping the guy who originally made these sheets (whoever he was) knew what he was doing when he assigned the SLs on his sheets. I tried my best to assign (what I thought would be) a reasonable amount of SLs for the freighter sheet. Considering that the Leviathan is so huge (1.2 km long!) I guestimated that it has about 32 SLs, compared to a cruiser's 20 and a frigate's 15. And since a Leviathan can carry 4 cruisers/frigates (as well as 12 hybrids), I figured it needed to be appropriately huge.<br /> <br /> If playtesters using these sheets find that I gave the freighter sheet too many SLs (or if the SLs on <i>all </i>of the sheets need to be reworked entirely), please let me or Mr. Gone know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-25-2015, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cus