.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T15:42:06-07:00","id":492977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=492964#post492964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">CHILL, PM me your email address and once the sheets are ready I'll get em to you. </div> </div> </div> </div>PM sent over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T17:12:57-07:00","id":493018,"title":"","content":"Just got back from work and I'm taking a look at the freighter sheet. Stay tuned.<br /> <br /> Just sent off my latest email to Mr. Gone with a couple of suggestions. The freighter sheet (our current working baseline for all the sheets) is shaping up very nicely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-26-2015, 09:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T18:18:45-07:00","id":494184,"title":"","content":"Mr. G just sent me his latest versions of all the finished starship sheets. I'm looking them over now and they look REALLY nice. Once I finish examining them and making sure there are no more needed improvements, Mr. Gone will put them up on his website as well as send off copies to CHILL to put into the EON Archive.<br /> <br /> Stay tuned.<br /> <br /> EDIT: some of the sheets were missing their Tech dropdown menus; I've just told Mr. G about this and he should fix it soon.<br /> <br /> EDIT2: THEY'RE DONE! I just finished my last proofread of the sheets and told Mr. G that they're ready. He's gonna put them on his website shortly. CHILL should be getting his copies for the Archive soon as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 04-27-2015, 09:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T19:03:49-07:00","id":494223,"title":"","content":"Trinity did not have cruisers originally the Tech Manual introduced them. I've played with ship designs off and on over the last 15 years my chronicles for Trinity tend to be exploration stories with worlds not written up. I needed a smaller ship than a Leviathon jump ship for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T19:30:24-07:00","id":494241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lncbill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=494223#post494223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trinity did not have cruisers; originally the Tech Manual introduced them. I've played with ship designs off and on over the last 15 years my chronicles for Trinity tend to be exploration stories with worlds not written up. I needed a smaller ship than a Leviathan jump ship for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless you had an Upeo wa Macho in the troupe, your only option for interstellar travel was the Leviathan jumpship. Unless, of course, you had a non-canon jumpship in the campaign. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T19:37:34-07:00","id":494244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/488990-trinity-starship-sheets-did-any-fan-make-these?p=494184#post494184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT2: THEY'RE DONE! I just finished my last proofread of the sheets and told Mr. G that they're ready. He's gonna put them on his website shortly. CHILL should be getting his copies for the Archive soon as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're all up on the site on the Aeonverse page. But here are the direct links:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Trinity/Trinity_StarshipSheet_Cruiser_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Trinity/Trinity_StarshipSheet_Cruiser_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Trinity/Trinity_StarshipSheet_Cruiser_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Trinity/Trinity_StarshipSheet_Cruiser_Interactive.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Trinity/Trinity_StarshipSheet_Fighter_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/goo